description: Use Node.js and npm instead of Bun, pnpm, or yarn.
globs: "*.ts, *.tsx, *.js, package.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

Default to Node.js and npm. This project has no Bun dependency.

- Use `npm install` instead of `bun install`
- Use `npm run <script>` instead of `bun run <script>`
- Use `npx <bin>` instead of `bunx <bin>`
- Use `node <file>` / `tsx <file>` instead of `bun <file>`
- Node has no automatic `.env` loading: `server.ts` calls `process.loadEnvFile('.env')` when the file exists

## Entry points

- `worker.ts` - Cloudflare Workers handler, the shared implementation of every route
- `server.ts` - thin `node:http` adapter that serves `worker.ts`'s `fetch` handler on Node (`npm start`)
- `providers/` and `translation.ts` - runtime-agnostic, `fetch`/`crypto.subtle` only
